        <h1>Polymarket Analytics</h1>
        <h2>Polymarket: Market Overview</h2>
        <p>Analyze the top trading markets on Polymarket, track liquidity, volume, and AI-powered probabilities.</p>

        <h2>Key Market Statistics</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Top 20 Markets:</strong> Ordered by liquidity and trading volume.</li>
            <li><strong>AI Probability:</strong> Compare human vs AI-calculated probabilities.</li>
            <li><strong>Market Trends:</strong> Interactive charts and insights.</li>
            <li><strong>Smart Score:</strong> Evaluate user performance based on historical trading success.</li>
        </ul>

