        <p><a href="https://hashdive.com/Analyze_User">Analyze User</a></p>

        <h2>Top Market Trends</h2>
        <div class="highlight">
            <p>Check out the latest market trends and price movements. Data-driven insights available for all top markets.</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Market Analysis Charts</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Market Data (Yes vs No):</strong> A comparison of market sentiment and price action.</li>
            <li><strong>Value per Entry Price:</strong> A visualization of positions by entry price.</li>
            <li><strong>Profit and Loss Distribution:</strong> Analysis of the top traders' positions.</li>
            <li><strong>Smart Score Distribution:</strong> Breakdown of traders' performance based on past market activities.</li>
